{"analytics_identifier":null,"base_path":"/government/publications/check-the-default-values-for-the-carbon-border-adjustment-mechanism-cbam/cement-default-values","content_id":"e8b2328e-01fc-4cdc-9e13-5feb002c0fed","description":null,"details":{"body":"<div class=\"govspeak\"><p>Use this guidance to find the default values to use for the cement sector. The values apply to each Carbon Border Adjustment Mechanism (<abbr title=\"Carbon Border Adjustment Mechanism\">CBAM</abbr>) good, regardless of origin.</p>\n\n<div role=\"note\" aria-label=\"Information\" class=\"application-notice info-notice\">\n  <p>If you submit a <abbr title=\"Carbon Border Adjustment Mechanism\">CBAM</abbr> return that uses default values, you cannot amend it later with actual emissions data.</p>\n</div>\n\n<p>The default values are sorted by combined nomenclature (<abbr title=\"Combined Nomenclature\">CN</abbr>) code. To find out the <abbr title=\"Combined Nomenclature\">CN</abbr> code for a good, you can <a href=\"https://www.gov.uk/trade-tariff\">use the Trade Tariff tool</a>.</p>\n\n<h2 id=\"using-default-values-and-actual-emissions\">Using default values and actual emissions</h2>\n\n<p>You can use default values to determine emissions in your <abbr title=\"Carbon Border Adjustment Mechanism\">CBAM</abbr> goods, including any <abbr title=\"Carbon Border Adjustment Mechanism\">CBAM</abbr> goods used to make a final <abbr title=\"Carbon Border Adjustment Mechanism\">CBAM</abbr> good (precursors).</p>\n\n<p>You can use default values for precursor goods when using actual emissions data for relevant processes associated with turning the precursor goods into final <abbr title=\"Carbon Border Adjustment Mechanism\">CBAM</abbr> goods.</p>\n\n<p>You cannot use actual emissions data for precursor <abbr title=\"Carbon Border Adjustment Mechanism\">CBAM</abbr> goods and default values for the final <abbr title=\"Carbon Border Adjustment Mechanism\">CBAM</abbr> good.</p>\n\n<h2 id=\"cement-default-values\">Cement default values</h2>\n\n<p>The following values replicate those of the <a href=\"https://www.gov.uk/government/publications/carbon-border-adjustment-mechanism-force-of-law-notice-and-reference-document\">Force of Law notice</a>. You must use them if you’re not reporting actual verified emissions.</p>\n\n<table>\n  <thead>\n    <tr>\n      <th scope=\"col\">Combined Nomenclature (<abbr title=\"Combined Nomenclature\">CN</abbr>) code</th>\n      <th scope=\"col\">Combined Nomenclature (<abbr title=\"Combined Nomenclature\">CN</abbr>) description</th>\n      <th scope=\"col\">Default value (tonnes of carbon dioxide equivalent (tCO2e) per tonne of product)</th>\n    </tr>\n  </thead>\n  <tbody>\n    <tr>\n      <td>25070080</td>\n      <td>Kaolinic clays (other than kaolin)</td>\n      <td>0.240 tCO2e per tonne</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>25231000</td>\n      <td>Cement clinkers</td>\n      <td>1.433 tCO2e per tonne</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>25232100</td>\n      <td>White Portland cement, whether or not artificially coloured</td>\n      <td>1.425 tCO2e per tonne</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>25232900</td>\n      <td>Portland cement (excluding white, whether or not artificially coloured)</td>\n      <td>1.375 tCO2e per tonne</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>25233000</td>\n      <td>Aluminous cement</td>\n      <td>2.075 tCO2e per tonne</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>25239000</td>\n      <td>Cement, whether or not coloured (excluding Portland cement and aluminous cement)</td>\n      <td>1.441 tCO2e per tonne</td>\n    </tr>\n  </tbody>\n</table>\n\n<p>If you want to find out how <abbr title=\"Carbon Border Adjustment Mechanism\">CBAM</abbr> default values are worked out, <a href=\"https://www.gov.uk/government/publications/carbon-border-adjustment-mechanism-force-of-law-notice-and-reference-document\">visit the Carbon Border Adjustment Mechanism: force of law notices and reference document</a>.</p>\n\n</div>","first_published_version":true,"headers":[{"id":"using-default-values-and-actual-emissions","level":2,"text":"Using default values and actual emissions"},{"id":"cement-default-values","level":2,"text":"Cement default values"}],"political":false,"public_timestamp":"2026-10-16T12:00:19.000+01:00"},"document_type":"html_publication","first_published_at":"2026-10-16T12:00:20+01:00","links":{"available_translations":[{"api_path":"/api/content/government/publications/check-the-default-values-for-the-carbon-border-adjustment-mechanism-cbam/cement-default-values","api_url":"https://www.gov.uk/api/content/government/publications/check-the-default-values-for-the-carbon-border-adjustment-mechanism-cbam/cement-default-values","base_path":"/government/publications/check-the-default-values-for-the-carbon-border-adjustment-mechanism-cbam/cement-default-values","content_id":"e8b2328e-01fc-4cdc-9e13-5feb002c0fed","document_type":"html_publication","links":{},"locale":"en","public_updated_at":"2026-10-16T11:00:19Z","schema_name":"html_publication","title":"Cement default values","web_url":"https://www.gov.uk/government/publications/check-the-default-values-for-the-carbon-border-adjustment-mechanism-cbam/cement-default-values","withdrawn":false}],"government":[{"api_path":"/api/content/government/2026-burnham-labour-government","api_url":"https://www.gov.uk/api/content/government/2026-burnham-labour-government","base_path":"/government/2026-burnham-labour-government","content_id":"1fb8162a-7f42-4a44-ae9b-42e8d8f36807","details":{"current":true,"ended_on":null,"started_on":"2026-07-20T00:00:00+00:00"},"document_type":"government","links":{},"locale":"en","title":"2026 Burnham Labour government","web_url":"https://www.gov.uk/government/2026-burnham-labour-government"}],"organisations":[{"analytics_identifier":"D25","api_path":"/api/content/government/organisations/hm-revenue-customs","api_url":"https://www.gov.uk/api/content/government/organisations/hm-revenue-customs","base_path":"/government/organis